        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "# node-forge RSA PKCS#1 v1.5 signature verification accepts extra nested DigestAlgorithm elements\\nnode-forge through 1.4.0 fails to validate element count in nested DigestAlgorithm sequences during RSA PKCS#1 v1.5 signature verification. Attackers can embed garbage bytes inside the DigestAlgorithm sequence to forge valid signatures for arbitrary messages using low-exponent RSA keys. This is an incomplete fix for CVE-2026-33894.\\n\\n## Aliases\\nCVE-2026-33894, CVE-2026-85393, GHSA-ppp5-5v6c-4jwp"
          }
        ],
